message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "SwarmLabs Engine Kit"
abstract: >-
  Open-source client SDK, reference MCP server, and agent Skills for the
  SwarmLabs physics-informed scientific-experiment automation engine. Includes
  vv-gate: a dependency-free, fail-closed verification gate that independently
  adjudicates a numeric prediction against a published held-out set and
  literature anchors, returning PROCEED / PROCEED_WITH_HUMAN_CHECK /
  BLOCK_AUTONOMOUS_ACTION.
type: software
authors:
